# Architecture

- One feature module owns each table. Export services, not repositories.
- Do not add `@Global()` to a feature module, and do not add `forwardRef`.
- Keep NestJS as a modular monolith. No microservices, Kafka, gRPC.
- Read `docs/architecture/MODULES.md` before adding a module.
